---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Refund Policy"
  description="Refund policy for Eternal Grace Hub digital purchases."
>
  <section class="content-page">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Refund Policy</h1><div
        class="prose"
      >
        <p>
          If a file is defective, inaccessible, duplicated, or materially
          different from its description, contact support with the order number
          so the team can repair access or review a refund.
        </p><h2>Digital delivery</h2><p>
          Because digital resources are delivered immediately, change-of-mind
          refunds may be limited after files have been accessed. Applicable
          consumer rights remain unaffected.
        </p><h2>Approved refunds</h2><p>
          Full refunds revoke access to all resources in the order. Partial
          refunds revoke access only to the refunded order items. Approved funds
          return to the original payment method through Stripe.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
